# New game: title, story, the prologue's tutorial fight and chapter 1's tutorials, played by mashing A (and the few moves
# the tutorial asks for: Franz's items, a trade, B to back out). It ends on the chapter 1 map with the cursor free on Seth,
# where the second screen shows his status (FE8-2); shots then walk the cursor about the map.
